# Phase 4, GA-8-1 + GA-8-2's recheck (2026-10-14): the carbon statute reads the boundary's calendar year and leaves a passed figure for its year;
# a budget bill names only the tax lines the player moved. The repro and the whole of area 8 (its carbon runs and its cabinet runs), and the whole
# of area 2, where the budget bills live (GA-8-2 changes every player's bill: a bill tabled before a boundary no longer sets back what the boundary
# moved, and Poland loses the phantom tax act). Area 2's twins are `p4_ga22` (§815's runs, the same harness, the engine before this change).
